  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5940\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_dg_title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1538\" height=\"481\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5941\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_dg_overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1538\" height=\"145\" /></p>\n\n<h2>描述</h2>\n我想要一种非常坚固的玻璃，但不想添加一个包含大量我不需要内容的模组。\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5942\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/eleY718.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1533\" height=\"797\" />\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5943\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/4HEsK3v.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"657\" height=\"303\" />\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5944\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/pVFRzj3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"447\" height=\"612\" />\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5945\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/mEckP4h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"436\" />\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5946\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/PI1gPLm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"365\" />\n\n本模组中的玻璃基于钻石和沙子。钻石玻璃方块、玻璃板、台阶和楼梯拥有和黑曜石相同的防爆抗性，放置后极难破坏，并且具有特殊的纹理，既无缝又无膜感。其余的支撑方块基于沙子，仅作为钻石沙方块的逻辑延伸而添加。\n\n&nbsp;\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<ul>\n \t<li>支持服务器端和客户端图形界面的配置。</li>\n \t<li>您可以更改提供的两种方块的硬度和爆炸抗性。</li>\n \t<li>可以将钻石玻璃变体设置为无敌状态，使其成为凋灵和末影龙博物馆的理想选择！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>整合包</h2>\n是的，你可以在你的整合包中使用我的模组。\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n \t<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/Shadows_Of_Fire\">Shadows_of_Fire</a> - 感谢你为我所做的一切精彩工作。</li>\n \t<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WbzhX7\">Minecraft Mod Development on Discord</a> - 许多非常聪明且知识渊博的人</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ngNQjT5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5947\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_dg_community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1538\" height=\"145\" /><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/96753964485181440/widget.png?style=banner2\" /></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/kreezxil\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s12.directupload.net/images/200916/joj33k55.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/MinecraftModdedForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s12.directupload.net/images/200916/efhmdjhg.png\" /></a></p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/kreezxil\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5948\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_dg_bisect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1538\" height=\"305\" /></a>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">如果你想以零 effort 为任何整合包设置服务器，请获取 <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/kreezxil\">BisectHosting 服务器</a> 并使用代码 kreezxil 作为新客户享受首月 25% 的折扣</p>\n&nbsp;\n<h2></h2>",
